          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibindi vyabaye ku ngoma ya Salomo, uhereye ku ntango ugashitsa kw’iherezo, mbega vyose ntivyanditswe mu vyagenda biraba vyanditswe na Natani uwavugishwa n’Imana, mu vyavugishijwe na Ahiya w’i Shilo no mu vyeretswe Ido uwerekwa vyerekeye Yerobowamu mwene Nebati? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Salomo yabaye ku ngoma i Yerusalemu aganza Abisirayeli bose kumara imyaka mirongo ine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Salomo arapfa ahamvya ba sekuruza; ahambwa mu Gisagara ca se Dawidi. Maze umuhungu wiwe Rehobowamu amusubirira ku ngoma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
